  "referenceNumber": "GHR0100",
  "remarks": "\nPacific Real Estate Property Management Company is an involved person under the Global Human Rights Sanctions Regulations 2020 because it is responsible for, has engaged in, or has facilitated, activity that violates the right not to be subjected to torture or cruel, inhuman or degrading treatment or punishment or the right not to be held in servitude or required to perform forced or compulsory labour   \n",
